@startuml
title Diagrama de Sequência — Fluxo de Checkout (React -> API -> RabbitMQ -> Worker -> PostgreSQL)
autonumber

participant "React\n(Frontend SPA)" as React
participant "API\n(Backend Node.js)" as API
queue "RabbitMQ\n(Message Broker)" as RMQ
participant "Worker\n(Background Consumer)" as Worker
database "PostgreSQL\n(Banco de Dados)" as DB

== Fase 1: Recebimento Síncrono e Enfileiramento Rápido ==

React -> API : POST /checkout\n{ userId, items, paymentData }
activate API

API -> API : Valida payload e gera protocolo (orderId)
API ->> RMQ : Publish mensagem na fila "checkout_queue"\n{ orderId, userId, items, paymentData }
activate RMQ

API --> React : HTTP 202 Accepted\n{ orderId, status: "PROCESSING", message: "Pedido em processamento" }
deactivate API

== Fase 2: Processamento Assíncrono pelo Worker ==

RMQ ->> Worker : Consume mensagem da "checkout_queue"
activate Worker

Worker -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB

Worker -> DB : INSERT INTO orders (id, user_id, status) VALUES ($1, $2, 'CONFIRMED')
Worker -> DB : INSERT INTO transactions (account_id, type, amount) VALUES ($1, 'DEBIT', $2)
Worker -> DB : UPDATE products SET stock = stock - $1 WHERE id = $2

alt Sucesso na Persistência
    Worker -> DB : COMMIT
    DB --> Worker : OK (Dados persistidos)
    Worker ->> RMQ : basic.ack() (Confirma e remove da fila)
else Erro de Negócio ou Falha no Banco
    Worker -> DB : ROLLBACK
    DB --> Worker : Alterações desfeitas
    Worker ->> RMQ : basic.nack(requeue=false) (Envia para Dead Letter Queue)
end

deactivate DB
deactivate Worker
deactivate RMQ
@enduml
